      "releaseNotes": "This update brings support for iPhone Duo, a redesigned onboarding experience, and improved FlightBridge connectivity.\n\nWhat’s New\n\n- iPhone Duo Support — Avionics Buddy now supports iPhone Duo, bringing your flight instruments, moving maps, and cockpit experience to the new device.\n\n- Completely Redesigned Onboarding — A beautiful new three-step introduction makes getting started easier than ever, from discovering the features to connecting FlightBridge and configuring permissions.\n\n- FlightBridge 1.0 Support — Improved communication with the latest Windows FlightBridge, while maintaining compatibility with previous versions.\n\n- FlightBridge Update Notifications — Get notified when a newer FlightBridge version is available, with direct links to update.\n\n- Performance & Stability Improvements — Various refinements to connectivity and the overall experience.\n\nThank you for flying with Avionics Buddy!",
